From 5dea5b2a590bf8eb0d563fed12bb67c0e70ee18b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:27:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(status): observe delivered completion receipts as done
 evidence via the landed receipt seam [daveey]

Pure completion verdict extracted from observe_owner_task, batched receipt/verifier
reads, and a done adapter for session_tasks and sidebar counts. Done requires a
verified, admitted, all-delivered receipt bound to the exact closing run.
No new store, writer, schema or outcome precedence.
